        "_uid": "3a801e0b-8fdd-d0f3-6087-a1ab05c530fa",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "By the end of the programme participants were able to understand the basic principles and practical application of SBE, allowing them to critically appraise the current educational needs of learners in Medicine and Nursing and how the utilisation of SBE can help alleviate them. The programme also presented, its 24 participants from Pakistan and East Africa, opportunities to interact with simulation specialist and expand their network for future collaboration.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "CIME would like to acknowledge our faculty and facilitators for their valuable time, commitment and kind support in making this online programme a success.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
